{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Artifact Trove is an ",["l","古物","artifact"]," container that can be traded from the ",["l","沙漠商人","Desert Trader"]," for 5 ",["l","万象晶球","Omni Geode"],"s each. The ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"]," may trade 3 Artifact Troves for 1 ",["l","古代珍宝鉴定指南","Treasure Appraisal Guide"],", provided the player has already obtained the power from that book. Up to 5 can be purchased from ",["l","乔治","George"],"'s ",["l","沙漠节","shop"]," at the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"]," for 10 Calico Eggs ",["l","卡利科三花蛋","Calico Egg"],"s each."]],["p",["It can also be obtained by ",["l","淘盘","panning"],", dropped by ",["l","幽灵头骨","Haunted Skull"],"s if all ",["l","收集包","Vault Bundles"]," have been completed, found in ",["l","补给箱","Supply Crate"],"s on the ",["l","农场地图","Beach Farm"]," once the player has upgraded the ",["l","农舍","Farmhouse"]," at least two times, or dug up from ",["l","远古斑点","Artifact Spot"],"s on ",["l","姜岛","Ginger Island"],". Four or five Artifact Troves can be obtained as a prize from the ",["l","镇长的庄园","Prize Machine"],". Five Artifact Troves may occasionally be found in ",["l","骷髅洞穴","treasure rooms"]," in the Skull Cavern. It can also be gifted by a ",["l","动物","pet"]," dog with max ",["l","动物","friendship"],"."]],["p",["Although most of the contents are artifacts, there are a few items, namely the ",["l","黄金南瓜","Golden Pumpkin"],", ",["l","珍珠","Pearl"],", ",["l","古代珍宝鉴定指南","Treasure Appraisal Guide"],", and ",["l","财宝箱","Treasure Chest"],", which are not."]],["p",["The Artifact Trove can be broken open at the ",["l","铁匠铺","Blacksmith"]," for 25g to obtain the contents inside. It cannot be broken open using a ",["l","晶球破开器","Geode Crusher"],"."]]]],["Contents",2,[["p",["All items below have an equal (3.6%) chance of appearing inside an Artifact Trove."]],["t",[[[["i","(O)117","Anchor"],"\n",["i","(O)103","Ancient Doll"],"\n",["i","(O)123","Ancient Drum"],"\n",["i","(O)114","Ancient Seed"],"\n",["i","(O)109","Ancient Sword"],"\n",["i","(O)101","Arrowhead"],"\n",["i","(O)119","Bone Flute"],"\n",["i","(O)105","Chewing Stick"],"\n",["i","(O)113","Chicken Statue"],"\n",["i","(O)100","Chipped Amphora"]],[["i","(O)116","Dried Starfish"],"\n",["i","(O)122","Dwarf Gadget"],"\n",["i","(O)121","Dwarvish Helm"],"\n",["i","(O)104","Elvish Jewelry"],"\n",["i","(O)118","Glass Shards"],"\n",["i","(O)124","Golden Mask"],"\n",["i","(O)373","Golden Pumpkin"],"\n",["i","(O)125","Golden Relic"],"\n",["i","(O)106","Ornamental Fan"]],[["i","(O)797","Pearl"],"\n",["i","(O)120","Prehistoric Handaxe"],"\n",["i","(O)115","Prehistoric Tool"],"\n",["i","(O)108","Rare Disc"],"\n",["i","(O)112","Rusty Cog"],"\n",["i","(O)110","Rusty Spoon"],"\n",["i","(O)111","Rusty Spur"],"\n",["i","(O)Book_Artifact","Treasure Appraisal Guide"],"\n",["i","(O)166","Treasure Chest"]]]]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Hate"]},[["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"]]]]]]],["Bundles",2,[["p",["Artifact Trove is not used in any ",["l","收集包","bundles"],"."]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["Artifact Trove is used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号","Sewing Machine"]," to create the ",["l","裁缝","Trinket Shirt"],"."]]]],["Quests",2,[["p",["Artifact Trove is not used in any ",["l","任务","quests"],"."]]]],["Notes",2,[["l",0,[[1,["By multiplying the sell price of each item by the chance to obtain it, the average profit of opening an Artifact Trove without having read the ",["l","古代珍宝鉴定指南","Treasure Appraisal Guide"]," is 472g, or 447g when the 25g opening cost is factored in. The profit after having read the guide is 660g, or 635g when the 25g opening cost is factored in."]],[1,["Since the average profit when breaking open an Omni Geode is 96g, and it takes five Omni Geodes to trade for one Artifact Trove (i.e., 482g) at the ",["l","沙漠商人","Desert Trader"],", you will typically lose 35g every time you trade for one (if you have not yet read the ",["l","古代珍宝鉴定指南","Treasure Appraisal Guide"],"). After having read it however, you will typically earn 153g per trade. This assumes you sell the contents."]]]]]]],"f":[["Source",[["l","沙漠商人","Desert Trader"]," • ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"]," • ",["l","淘盘","Panning"]," • ",["l","幽灵头骨","Haunted Skull"]," • ",["l","远古斑点","Artifact Spot"],"s on ",["l","姜岛","Ginger Island"]," • ",["l","镇长的庄园","Mayor's Manor"]," • ",["l","动物","Dog"]]],["Sell Price",["0g"]]]}